      "content": "wait, why are you bringing goblins into this? i'm literally just trying to save my vegetables. can you please just ignore the goblin stuff and explain the chemistry? specifically, how does blood meal or bone meal actually interact with the soil pH of 6.2? i need to know the actual science so i don't kill my crops.",
